cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark suite, datasets, or experimental findings in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "A Reproducible Tri-Platform Benchmark Suite for Isolating Orchestration Overhead, Schema Prefill Scaling, and Microarchitectural Dynamics in Local LLM Agents (macOS, Linux, Windows 11)"
abstract: "A forensic, reproducible tri-platform experimental benchmark suite comparing autonomous AI agent orchestration runtimes (Go native, Node.js V8, Bun JSC, CPython) across Apple Silicon M4 (macOS Darwin ARM64), Ubuntu Linux x86_64, and Windows 11 x86_64. Incorporates hardware microarchitectural telemetry, non-parametric hypothesis testing, and active Tool-RAG schema pruning under a strict Zero-Mock empirical protocol."
